- [X] I have confirmed that this bug belongs to the current repository, not other repositories of RocketMQ.


### Runtime platform environment

Mac  OS 13.0

### RocketMQ version

branch: (develop|tag 5.1.1) version: 5.1.1

### JDK Version

jdk8

### Describe the Bug

[ConcurrentHashMapUtils](https://github.com/apache/rocketmq/blob/develop/common/src/main/java/org/apache/rocketmq/common/utils/ConcurrentHashMapUtils.java) 中提供的computeIfAbsent方法没有解决jdk8的循环问题，复现代码如下

```
@Test
    public void computeIfAbsent() {
        ConcurrentHashMap<String, String> map = new ConcurrentHashMap<>();
//        map.computeIfAbsent("AaAa", key->map.computeIfAbsent("BBBB",key2->"42"));
        ConcurrentHashMapUtils.computeIfAbsent(map, "AaAa", key -> map.computeIfAbsent("BBBB", key2 -> "42"));
    }
```
